+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+Requests a page of the authenticated user's conversation summaries. `limit`, when present, MUST be an integer from 1 to 200. `before`, when present, MUST contain a 1–128 character `sessionId` and an `updatedAt` string accepted by `Date.parse`; unknown fields such as `userId` are ignored ([validated by: validates list_conversations paging fields](../../src/transport/ws/validation.test.ts#L24)).
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_conversations",
+  "limit": 50,
+  "before": {"updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z", "sessionId": "session-123"}
+}
+```
+
+| Field    | Type   | Required | Description |
+| -------- | ------ | -------- | ----------- |
+| `type`   | string | Yes      | `"list_conversations"` |
+| `limit`  | number | No       | Page size from 1 to 200 |
+| `before` | object | No       | Composite cursor with `updatedAt` and `sessionId` |
